#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:8
msgid "零拷贝"
msgstr "Zero-Copy"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:10
msgid "零拷贝发送 API 在调用者提供的可写存储中构造单帧非可靠消息，不引入异步缓冲所有权。"
msgstr ""
"The zero-copy send APIs build a single unreliable frame in caller-owned writable storage. They do not "
"introduce asynchronous buffer ownership."

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:12
msgid "支持范围"
msgstr "Supported Scope"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:0
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:0
msgid "作用域与用途"
msgstr "Scope and purpose"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:0
msgid "`xgl_send_zerocopy_at()`"
msgstr "`xgl_send_zerocopy_at()`"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:0
msgid "保留原有描述符；connection ID 与 session epoch 均为零"
msgstr "Legacy descriptor; connection ID and session epoch are both zero"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:0
msgid "`xgl_send_zerocopy_scoped_at()`"
msgstr "`xgl_send_zerocopy_scoped_at()`"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:0
msgid "通过 `xgl_tx_zerocopy_request_t` 指定 connection ID 与 session epoch"
msgstr "`xgl_tx_zerocopy_request_t` selects an explicit connection ID and session epoch"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:0
msgid "`xgl_send_zerocopy_layout()`"
msgstr "`xgl_send_zerocopy_layout()`"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:0
msgid "查询指定作用域请求的精确载荷偏移与完整帧大小"
msgstr "Queries the exact payload offset and complete frame size for the scoped request"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:20
msgid ""
"两个发送 API 均只支持单帧非可靠发送。`reliable=true` 返回 `XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM`，`timeout_ms` 不参与处理。可靠发送使用 "
"`xgl_send_at()`。认证发送要求已为选定的目标、connection ID 与 session epoch 安装可信会话。"
msgstr ""
"Both send APIs support only single-frame, unreliable transmission. `reliable=true` is rejected with "
"`XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM`, and `timeout_ms` is ignored. Use `xgl_send_at()` for reliable DATA. "
"Authenticated sending requires a trusted session installed for the selected target, connection ID and "
"session epoch."

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:22
msgid "缓冲布局"
msgstr "Buffer Layout"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:24
msgid "载荷前预留精确头部空间，载荷后预留尾部空间："
msgstr "Reserve exact headroom before the payload and trailer capacity after it:"

